    <h3>Behavioral Interview</h3>
    <p>Questions about your experiences, how you handle situations, and team dynamics. Uses STAR framework.</p>
   </div>
   <div class="card">
    <div class="icon">💻</div>
    <h3>Technical Interview</h3>
    <p>Coding problems, system design, debugging. Tests your problem-solving and coding skills.</p>
   </div>
   <div class="card">
    <div class="icon">🤝</div>
    <h3>Phone Screen</h3>
    <p>Initial 30–45 min call. Mix of behavioral and technical questions. Filters candidates.</p>
   </div>
   <div class="card">
    <div class="icon">🏢</div>
    <h3>On-Site Round</h3>
    <p>4–6 hours with multiple interviews. Deeper technical and team fit assessment.</p>
   </div>
